  "body": "Whether you're an investor looking to strengthen your property portfolio or a first-home buyer ready to take your first step onto the property ladder, this well-positioned three-bedroom home is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nSet back from the road via a right of way, this home offers a practical and comfortable layout designed for easy everyday living. The spacious lounge flows naturally through to the dining area and kitchen, creating a welcoming space for both family time and entertaining.\r\n\r\nStep outside from the lounge onto the deck and enjoy the fully fenced, easy-care garden. The outdoor area provides a safe and private space for children to play and for the family to enjoy.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is well catered for with three bedrooms, a separate toilet and a family bathroom conveniently positioned along the hallway. A large carport provides covered parking, complemented by additional off-street parking and a handy shed for extra storage.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to main arterial routes and everyday amenities, this property offers easy access to everything you need while providing a comfortable home to move straight into.\r\n\r\nZoned for regarded Macleans Primary School, Howick Intermediate, and Pakuranga College, this is an excellent opportunity for families seeking quality education options in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home or a solid investment, this one deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out — contact us today to arrange your private viewing or join our open home.",
